###STATIC_IP_MUST_SETUP(below steps are usable to setup the static ip)

static additional step:-
sudo vi /etc/cloud/cloud.cfg.d/99-disable-network-config.cfg
network: {config: disabled}

then in /etc/netplan/<file_name>
network:
  version: 2
  ethernets:
    ens34:
     dhcp4: no
     addresses:
       - 192.168.17.74/22
     routes:
       - to: default
         via: 192.168.16.1
     nameservers:
       addresses:
         - 192.168.19.25

       #ens35:
     #dhcp4: true
__________________
These below steps are not mandotary

sudo systemctl restart NetworkManager   (if not available install network-manager)
nmcli connection add con-name static ifname ens34 type ethernet autoconnect yes ipv4.addresses 192.168.17.17/22
sudo systemctl restart NetworkManager
nmcli con up static

